  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "秋ê跤步"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭如絜</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">山崙頂溫柔ê筆跡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">勻勻仔leh變魔術</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tńg-se̍h節氣ê衫仔裙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tòo kah像新娘ê嬌容</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiah-nī仔溫柔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">輕輕仔liam出跤步</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">用心　感受伊ê suí</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夜--裡　風吹thàng樹ínn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Si-si-su̍t-su̍t　親像</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sau聲ê歌喉唱出月夜愁</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水溝仔邊行踏ê暗光鳥</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tuè leh唱　gàn--人ê露水</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">hōo人心稀微</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kǹg心ê夜風　涼冷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">恬恬peh-tsiūnn眠床頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">薄被　失去溫暖ê重量</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日短暝長　一冬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">又koh行來到尾溜--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">時日　交替ê冷暖中</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khuann-khuann仔走入冬</span></p><span><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/w450-h640/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiWSBZIWWJ7j7bZmyn2T5ZhfuzP1nBrEXqRYux2D0D2LQ6ElD4umspnCnb9lsl6jXbWVadQtTvyiLUg8UVjEQtFkh_I9FXxIE6b52R_KfGCfHO-69k1P-lynjULQJwSu6h_N2a1L4ekd0QnqI-kyjx6XtsUtp8H7XaNF7GTDaFUf7vkqc8HNsyUNz-CVg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1342%E6%9C%9F_05.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"h